  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="65f90ce3-4ac8-5e64-8191-155e2be72830" activityNameId="35d8ce3b-1981-5fa0-b26c-c768b0122a55" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, sewer system, GFRP pipe, SN 10000-20000, DN 300, profile 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, sewer system, GFRP pipe, SN 10000-20000, DN 300, profile 4
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: d7b7ecb0-bb52-4cc0-a535-e92d05116cf8
This process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with GFRP (glass fibre reinforced plastic) pipe. SN 10000-20000, DN 300, profile 4 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with GFRP pipe, DN 300, profile 4. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: SN 10000-20000, DN 300, profile 4 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. GFRP pipe, ID 310-316 mm, outer diameter 324 mm, wall thickness 4-7 mm, 6.6-11.5 kg/m, 1650 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d7b7ecb0-bb52-4cc0-a535-e92d05116cf8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
